<SCENARIO VER="105">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ワゴン後部座席昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>After we left the rest stop and had driven for a while, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> fell asleep again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... So in the end, what were the curse-killings all about...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Let's see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> insisting so firmly that 'I did it' is what actually makes it sound like a lie..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> tried to kill us makes no sense at all either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"One possible motive would be that we were close to reaching the truth of the curse-killings, I suppose..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What do </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> want to do? Do you still want to solve every mystery?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"There probably won't be any more curse-killings now, though... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But I―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's enough now, both of you. What I had you all come for was to stop the curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">It's... fine now, isn't it? Leave it at that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">? Is that really fine?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I can't put all of you in any more danger..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>'s tone was as if, to keep us from deducing any further, she was deliberately <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="さえぎ">cutting us off</STYLE>...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you actually know something, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"It's... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">fine now, isn't it...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But we nearly got killed!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　At least we could think about why we were the ones targeted...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> wouldn't say anything more.<PG>
We had achieved the bare minimum goal of not letting the curse-killings happen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... there are still far too many mysteries left.<PG>
Why did <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> go after even us?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why was <STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE>'s head cut off?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>The day these mysteries are solved―
{PAUSE ""}
will it ever come?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>"............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">Those eyes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"My eyes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Here, look!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> turned on the camera and pointed her phone's screen at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I'm supposed to use it as a mirror?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\死月編\また会おうね.１.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "人物2" "QUAKE" "1" "30" "30" "0" "3000"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, a little higher."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Like this?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
